### ==========================================================================
### CampusVote - VS Code REST Client API Queries
### (Works with VS Code "REST Client" extension or cURL)
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login as Student USN 33 (Kiran Kumar)
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "U15FY24S0033",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Save Student Token
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### 3. Get Student Profile & Voting History
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 4. Get Active Elections & Contests
GET {{baseUrl}}/elections

### 5. Get Election Details with Positions & Candidates
GET {{baseUrl}}/elections/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 6. Cast Vote for President (Candidate ID: 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes/cast
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "election_id": 1,
  "position_id": 1,
  "candidate_id": 1
}

### 7. Public Cryptographic Receipt Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/votes/receipt/CV-2026-A1B2C3D4

### 8. View Live Election Results & Turnout Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/results/1

### 9. Login as Admin / Chief Election Officer
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "ADMIN001",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Save Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 10. Admin: View All Registered Voters
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/voters
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Admin: View System Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Admin: Reset & Re-Seed Database for Presentation
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reset-seed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
